  "type": "feat",
  "name": "Fated Circle (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a standard action, the field specialist can charge energy from the ammo into his gun arm and swing it around furiously, dealing 1d6 points of fire damage and 1d6 points of lightning damage plus 1d6 damage of each type for every three field specialist levels he possesses to all enemies in a 20-ft.-radius around the field specialist. A successful Reflex save (DC 10 + half of the field specialist’s level + his Charisma modifier) reduces this damage by half. Those who fail the save are staggered for 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Requires Gunbreaker 9.</strong></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
